  - Switched `Menubar:RadioGroup` -> `Menubar:RadioItem` name sharing to `provide()`/`inject()` (set `name` once on the group)
  - Fixed the manifest: added the deps actually used (`twig/html-extra`, `symfony/ux-icons`, `symfony/ux-twig-component`), added `version-added`, dropped `description` (not in the schema)
  - Cleaned up docblocks (`@prop`/`@block`), moved the CHANGELOG entry to `3.5.0`, added missing test fixture icons, regenerated snapshots
  - Gave each README preview example a `min-height` wrapper so dropdowns aren't clipped by the preview viewport on hover

